Package: am5-spd-diag
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, systemd
Recommends: dmidecode, i2c-tools, pkexec | policykit-1, glow | python3-rich, python3-gi
Description: AM5 DDR5 SPD hub diagnostics after sleep/warm reboot
 Capture DIMM/SPD identity across boot, shutdown, and systemd sleep/resume
 on AMD AM5 systems. Helps document the AGESA/firmware failure where a
 warm reboot after sleep reports Unknown/2 GiB DIMMs until AC power is
 removed.
 .
 Optional tools: dmidecode (SMBIOS fallback), i2c-tools (SPD5118 hub
 probe/recover), pkexec (graphical snapshot for report/package), and glow
 or python3-rich (markdown report paging from the notification).
